{"title":"The Hand-Painted Storefront Signs of Detroit by Ron Miller","link":"https://kottke.org/25/08/the-hand-painted-storefront-signs-of-detroit-by-ron-miller","date":1755873375000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/ron–signs-detroit.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/ron–signs-detroit.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/ron–signs-detroit.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1503\" alt=\"a number of storefront signs\" /></p>\n\n<p>Ron Miller is one of the most prolific sign painters in Detroit. Photographer Andrew Anderson <a href=\"https://andrewandersonphoto.com/ron-signs\">has collected dozens of images of Miller’s signs from Google Street View</a>.</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>Ron Miller has been painting signs since 1978. He loves adding color to the neighborhood with his work. He has no website, no email and works all by word of mouth in Detroit.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>Anderson also made <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/d/u/0/viewer?mid=1Q_TsIHQheiaa_9KxN-nBgP-IalZ4S00&amp;ll=42.38283217019485%2C-83.09412765502931&amp;z=12\">a map of the locations of Miller’s signs</a>. And here’s the man himself:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/ron–signs-detroit-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/ron–signs-detroit-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/ron–signs-detroit-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1016\" height=\"1157\" alt=\"a photo of a man standing in front of a truck, covered in many different colors of paint\" /></p>\n\n<p>(thx, jordan)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Andrew%20Anderson\">Andrew Anderson</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Ron%20Miller\">Ron Miller</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/typography\">typography</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/08/the-hand-painted-storefront-signs-of-detroit-by-ron-miller\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"1ed5b7f10c720f0314916aa7329371823369eb8c501f1e1a93b78d52b241053c","category":"Sites"}